senses.gloss:
(II)--(Dhanada): the guardian of the north;
1: M. ६७. १५; Vi. V. ३६. १२.
presents of, at उमा's marriage;
2: M. १५४. ४८९.
in the army of deva's at तारकामय; riding animal of, man;
3: M. १७४. १७-18.
हरिकेश got this status at Benares; became अन्नद and क्षेत्रपाल; Udbhrama and Sambhrama, two गणस् in his service.
4: M. १८०. ९४-99.
